1
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,235
Night three. Count them.

2
00:00:06,515 --> 00:00:07,730
Camera must match window.

3
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:08,901
If not, close it.

4
00:00:11,301 --> 00:00:12,218
Two skewers, please.

5
00:00:13,851 --> 00:00:16,251
One at the window. One on camera. Good.

6
00:00:17,751 --> 00:00:18,257
Coming up.

7
00:00:20,851 --> 00:00:22,228
Thanks. Keep the change.

8
00:00:25,351 --> 00:00:26,204
The usual, dear.

9
00:00:27,651 --> 00:00:30,269
Two on camera. One at the window.

10
00:00:31,351 --> 00:00:34,827
Ma'am. Who is standing behind you?

11
00:00:35,107 --> 00:00:35,931
Behind me, dear?

12
00:00:37,081 --> 00:00:38,024
Count says no, ma'am.

13
00:00:39,581 --> 00:00:40,050
...Rude.

14
00:00:41,681 --> 00:00:42,405
...That wasn't her.

15
00:00:45,131 --> 00:00:45,959
Three skewers.

16
00:00:46,239 --> 00:00:48,058
Two for us. One for the little one.

17
00:00:49,981 --> 00:00:52,419
Three on camera. TWO at the window.

18
00:00:53,981 --> 00:00:56,764
...Oh. A kid.

19
00:00:57,044 --> 00:00:57,309
Hi!

20
00:00:58,459 --> 00:00:58,900
Thanks!

21
00:01:01,259 --> 00:01:02,936
Three rules. Zero problems.

22
00:01:04,459 --> 00:01:05,945
One. Two.

23
00:01:06,225 --> 00:01:07,177
Two... in here?

24
00:01:09,759 --> 00:01:10,677
...There's nobody.

25
00:01:13,109 --> 00:01:14,104
Count again.

26
00:01:15,759 --> 00:01:17,715
Night four. Count yourself.
